MSG_DEFER_HELP
Periferikoa oraindik ez badago sarea abiaraztean\n(konexio beroko, haririk gabeko edo Bluetooth hardwarea), saiatzen jarraitu\neta abiarazi interfazea periferikoa agertu bezain laster.\nBestela, zer egin nahi duzun galdetuko zaizu.
; If the device is not there yet when the network starts\n(hot-plugged, wireless or Bluetooth hardware), keep trying\nand start the interface as soon as the device appears.\nOtherwise you are asked what to do.
;
